-**One status file beside variant source:** `VARIANT_STATUS.ini`, per-game WITHDRAWN with effective draw/reason (one-way), and `prevailing_ov1_first_eligible_draw` written ONCE after a SUCCESSFUL results step. This status travels with QA software copy, not data reseed. A withdrawn variant cannot simply be un-withdrawn except restoring an earlier entire backup or installing a NEW variant. It is not part of immutable scientific fingerprint; a self-check catches accidental hand edits; concurrent withdrawal is serialised with job and updater locks, and a pending FORECAST at withdrawal draw remains unscored forever.
